<details class="other-pricing" id="other-pricing-and-credit"><summary>Other pricing and credit</summary><h3>Larger engagements</h3>
<p>Larger households, several residences or household staff: <strong>from ₪90,000</strong>. Scope and one fixed price are agreed in writing after the Assessment.</p>
<h3>Annual Care</h3>
<p>For past clients after the 60-day question line: <strong>₪12,000 a year</strong> for one person · <strong>₪15,000 a year</strong> for two · <strong>₪20,000 a year</strong> for a household of up to four.</p>
<h3>Urgent visits</h3>
<p>Availability is confirmed before payment. The urgent surcharge is <strong>₪4,800</strong>; weekends and holidays are <strong>₪6,000</strong>, replacing the ordinary surcharge. With the ₪4,000 Assessment, the totals are <strong>₪8,800</strong> or <strong>₪10,000</strong>.</p>
<h3>Assessment credit</h3>
<p>The ₪4,000 Assessment counts toward protection if the work begins within 30 days of Assessment completion. Remaining balances: <strong>₪28,000</strong> for Personal Shield · <strong>₪41,000</strong> for Personal Shield for Two · <strong>₪66,000</strong> for Inner Circle. The credit applies once to a group engagement. After 30 days, the Shield is charged at its full price.</p>
</details>
